nd support, and they were often exposed to enemy fire during these missions. For example, during the famous \"Dambusters\" raid in 1943, ground crew members flew in Lancaster bombers alongside the pilots and aircrew to maintain the aircraft and equipment during the mission. These ground crew members were exposed to enemy fire and several of them were killed or injured. RAF ground crew also worked under difficult and dangerous conditions in remote locations, such as in North Africa and the Middle East. In these locations, ground crew had to maintain aircraft and equipment in extreme heat and harsh desert conditions while under threat from enemy air and ground attacks. Many ground crew members were awarded medals for their bravery and service during WWII."},"rarity":"ERarityEnum::Unique","cardSet":"ECardSetEnum::BrothersInArms","isReserved":true,"usedTriggers":["ERegisteredCardFunction::OnEndOfTurn","ERegisteredCardFunction::OnOtherCardPlayedFromHand","ERegisteredCardFunction::ERegisteredCardFunction_MAX","ERegisteredCardFunction::OnOtherCardReset"],"soundEnterPlay":{"ObjectName":"SoundWave'War_UI_Drum_Movement_Field_Snares_3'","ObjectPath":"kards/Content/War_UI/Waves/Drum_Movements/War_UI_Drum_Movement_Field_Snares_3.0"},"Image":{"AssetPathName":"/Game/Assets/Textures/Images/Britain/Spring2023Candidates/t_spitfires_ground.t_spitfires_ground","SubPathString":""},"artist":"Michael Turner","historyPhoto":{"AssetPathName":"/Game/Assets/Textures/HistoricalPhotos/COMMITTED_CREW.COMMITTED_CREW","SubPathString":""},"historyPhotoSize":{"X":381.0,"Y":512.0},"historyPhotoDescription":{"Namespace":"card_britain","Key":"card_event_committed_crew_photo","SourceString":"RAF ground crew servicing a Spitfire during the Battle of Britain, September 1940.","LocalizedString":"RAF ground crew servicing a Spitfire during the Battle of Britain, September 1940."},"OnAttackVisualsSoft":{"AssetPathName":"/Game/Blueprints/Effects/BP_AttackOrder.BP_AttackOrder_C","SubPathString":""},"Notes":"Im